                <pb facs="0747" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg659"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tyler to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-05-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 5,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Tyler reports that the American legation and the British minister presented
                    a joint note to the prime minister insisting upon the immediate dispatch of a
                    fully equipped expedition for the capture of the murderers of Labaree.)<anchor
                        n="a" xml:id="d609-f1"/></p>
            </div>
        </body>
